{
  "id": "JHN.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 5",
  "verseCount": 47,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo kabyahoire Abayahudi bakaba baina ekiro kikuru kyabo, Yesu nawe agya Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli Yerusalemu haihi n'Ekihigi ky'Entaama bhakaba haliho ekitunga, omu Ruyahudi nikyetwa Betizata, kiina amataho gatanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mataaho ago bhakaba habyamirwemu abarwaire bangi muno: Empume, abalema, abakabire orubaju, [balinzire amaizi kagatabukilira; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba omumalaika wa Ruhanga yasongokaga omu rutunga, atabura amaizi. Omuntu ayatahaga omu rutunga ali wa mbere amaizi gatabukiliire akira endwara yona eyaba emukwete.] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omw'itaho bhakaba halimu omushaija amazire emyaka 38 arwaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Yesu yamuboine mara akamanya okwo yabyamire omwo omwanya gurai, amubaza ati, “Nogonza kutambirwa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omurwaire amuhorora ati, “Waitu, tinyina muntu wa kunteeka mu kitunga orwo amaizi galikutabukilira; kandikuba ningenda omuntu ondijo agantahiramu mbere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu amugambira ati, “Imuka, shutura amachera gawe, ogende.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho n'aho omushaija akira, ashutura amachera ga wenene atambuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo ekaba eli Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo Abayahudi kugambira omushaija ayakizire bati, “Kiro kya Sabato; notangwa kushutura amachera gawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi wenene abahorora ati, “Omushaija ayankiza yangambira ati, ‘Shutura amachera gawe otambuke.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamubaza bati, “Omushaija ayakugambira kushutura amachera gawe okagenda n'ohai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushaija ayakiziibwe tiyamanyire n'ohai Yesu hakaba atakizoka, embaga eyabaire eli aho ekaba eli nyingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma Yesu ashanga omushaija ogwo Rwensinga, amugambira ati, “Wabona okwo wakira! Otalifakara rundi okaija okagwerwa enaku ezishaagireho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushaija akwata omuhanda agenda agambira Abayahudi okwo ayamukiza ni Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo Abayahudi kugingiiza Yesu aha rw'okugira atyo ahali Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Yesu abahorora ati, “Tata akyakora, na inye ninkora.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Abayahudi beyongera kumuhiiga kumwita, kuba tiyahenzire muhango gwa Sabato gwonkai, akashuba Ruhanga yamweta Ishe, yayeiganisa na Ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu agambira Abayahudi ati, “Nimbagambira amazima, Omwana taina kukora kyo wenene yayenda, shana ekyo yabona Ishe nakora. Kuba ekyo Ishe akora, ekyo kyonene nikyo Omwana akora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishe agonza Omwana mara amwoleka byona ebyo akora. Kandi naija kumwoleka eby'amani kushaaga ebi mwije mutangare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Ishe ahimbura abafu hakabaha oburora, kutyo n'Omwana aha oburora ab'ayenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishe taramura muntu, kyonkai obushobora bwona bw'okuramura akabuha Omwana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abantu bona babone kuha Omwana ekitinwa, ekitinwa ekyo baha Ishe. Ataha Mwana kitinwa aba nakiima Ishe ayamutumire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbagambira amazima, ahulira ekigambo kyange akashuba akesiga ayantumire ogwo aina oburora obutalihwaho. Ogwo taliramurwa, kuba yakizire ahali rufu, yaboine oburora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nimbagambira amazima, esaa neija kwija, nangu na mbwenu aha niyo yonene, orwo abafu balihulira eiraka ly'Omwana wa Ruhanga, mara abalihulira eiraka elyo balirora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba okwo Ishe wenene aina oburora, nikwo yasingiire Mwana na wenene kugira oburora, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamuha n'obushobora bw'okuramura, aha rw'okuba Mwana w'Omuntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki kitabatangaza; kuba esaa neija kwija orwo bona abali omu bituro barahulira eirakalye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakahimbuka bakabona oburora, nibo baliinya abakozire kurungi. Kyonkai abakozire kubi n'orwo balihimbuka baliramurwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Taliho kyonakukora mu bushobora bwange. Okwo mpulira mba nikwo ndamura. Kandi eiramu lyange liba ly'amazima; kuba tinkora kyondikwenda, nkora ekyo ayantumire alikwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandaba n'inyejulira inye nyenene obujulizi bwange ti bwa mazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haliho ondijo anjulira, mara nimanya okwo obujulizi obwo alikunjulira bw'amazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutumire ahali Yohana, yajulira amazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye tindagiirwe kujulirwa muntu; ebi nimbigamba kamurokoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohana abaire ali tara elikwaka, ekamulikiza banu. Mara mukabanza mwashemelerwaho akaanya kake kubona nabamulikiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai inye obujulizi obwo nyinabwo nibushaga obwa Yohana, kuba ebyo Tata yantungire kugobesheleza, nibyo byonene byonene ebi ebyo ndikukora, nibinjulira okwo natumirwe Tata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Tata ayantumire anjuliire. Timukahuliraga irakalye, kandi timukabonaga kwo ashusha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ekigambokye tikibasingiiremu, kuba owo yatumire timulikumwikiliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimuhenjuuza Ebihandiko Bitakatifu nimulenga muti omwo nimwo muraihya oburora obutalihwaho; kandi Ebihandiko byonene nibyo bilikunjulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai nimwanga kunyijaho kubona oburora obutalihwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye ekitinwa tindikukihabwa bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nimanya okwo mutalikugonza Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaija omw'ibara lya Tata, kyonkai timulikunkunda. K'omuntu ondijo arayeizira, ogwo nimwija kumukunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimugonza okuhaisilizangana, kandi timulikutaho mani kuhiiga kitinwa ekiruga ahali Ruhanga omoi wenkai, aho mwakunyikiliza mutai? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutakutekeleza muti ninyija kubatoijela ahali Tata. Musa owo mushuubira n'iwe alikubatoijera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamwakubaire nimwikiliza Musa, nanye mwakunyikiliize, aha rw'okuba n'inye yahandikiireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawesi kamutalikwikiliza byo yahandikiire, muraikiliza mutai ebyo ndikubagambira?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
